    "mutations": [
      {
        "body": "The Grotesque Tree is the immediate arrival threat in Area 5: it looms over the approach, has armor-hard bark and thick thorns, and fights back against anyone who gets close or attacks from range. It should feel like a sudden, dangerous landmark rather than a passive scene-setter.\n\nKeep the metal leaves as a separate Perception-gated discovery. Do not fold them into the read-aloud; instead, reveal them only if a character\u2019s Passive Wisdom (Perception) 15 notices the shiny leaves on odd branches. The tree\u2019s magic aura and arcane-infused roots are also separate calls to action, not part of the opening narration.",
